@page "/"
@attribute [Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authorization.AllowAnonymous]
<PageTitle>Work-Wise | Your work, clearly organised</PageTitle>
<div class="ww-dashboard">
  <section class="ww-hero">
    <div class="ww-hero-copy">
      <span class="ww-kicker"><span class="ww-kicker-dot"></span> EMPLOYMENT WORKSPACE</span>
      <AuthorizeView>
        <Authorized><h1>Good to have you back.</h1><p>Your work details, leave requests and employment information - organised in one clear place.</p></Authorized>
        <NotAuthorized><h1>Work should feel clearer.</h1><p>Keep employment details, leave and workplace records together, so the important things are easier to understand.</p></NotAuthorized>
      </AuthorizeView>
      <div class="ww-hero-actions">
        <AuthorizeView>
          <Authorized><a class="ww-btn-primary" href="leave">Open leave centre <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="ww-btn-ghost" href="workspace">Employer workspace</a></Authorized>
          <NotAuthorized><a class="ww-btn-primary" href="Account/Register">Create your account <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="ww-btn-ghost" href="Account/Login">Sign in</a></NotAuthorized>
        </AuthorizeView>
      </div>
      <div class="ww-hero-foot"><span class="ww-mini-check">OK</span> Designed for workplaces in Namibia and South Africa</div>
    </div>
    <div class="ww-hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="ww-visual-glow"></div><div class="ww-visual-orbit ww-visual-orbit-one"></div><div class="ww-visual-orbit ww-visual-orbit-two"></div>
      <div class="ww-visual-card"><div class="ww-visual-card-head"><span class="ww-visual-check">OK</span><span>YOUR WORKSPACE</span><span class="ww-live-dot"></span></div><div class="ww-visual-title">Everything,<br />in one place.</div><div class="ww-visual-line"><span></span><span></span></div><div class="ww-visual-bottom"><span>Leave & absences</span><strong>Explore →</strong></div></div>
      <div class="ww-float-card ww-float-top"><span class="ww-float-icon ww-blue" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 3.75h7l4 4V20.25H7z"/><path d="M14 3.75v4h4M10 12h5M10 15.5h5"/></svg></span><span><strong>Employment records</strong><small>Clear and organised</small></span></div>
      <div class="ww-float-card ww-float-bottom"><span class="ww-float-icon ww-gold" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="5" y="4.5" width="14" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M9 4.5v-1h6v1M8.5 10h7M8.5 13.5h7M8.5 17h4"/></svg></span><span><strong>Leave tracking</strong><small>Requests and decisions</small></span></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="ww-section-head"><div><span class="ww-section-label">YOUR WORKPLACE TOOLKIT</span><h2>What would you like to take care of?</h2></div><p>Practical tools for employees and employers, with important details kept visible.</p></section>
  <section class="ww-tools-grid">
    <a class="ww-tool-card" href="leave"><div class="ww-tool-top"><span class="ww-tool-icon ww-icon-blue" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="5" y="4.5" width="14" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M9 4.5v-1h6v1M8.5 10h7M8.5 13.5h7M8.5 17h4"/></svg></span><span class="ww-tool-arrow">-></span></div><span class="ww-tool-label">TIME AWAY</span><h3>Leave & absences</h3><p>Submit leave requests, follow decisions and review the information available for your workplace.</p><span class="ww-card-link">Open leave centre <span>→</span></span></a>
    <a class="ww-tool-card" href="contracts"><div class="ww-tool-top"><span class="ww-tool-icon ww-icon-violet" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 3.75h7l4 4V20.25H7z"/><path d="M14 3.75v4h4M10 12h5M10 15.5h5"/></svg></span><span class="ww-tool-arrow">-></span></div><span class="ww-tool-label">EMPLOYMENT DETAILS</span><h3>Contracts & records</h3><p>Keep employment information in view and see what document tools are currently available.</p><span class="ww-card-link">View contract tools <span>→</span></span></a>
    <a class="ww-tool-card" href="benefits"><div class="ww-tool-top"><span class="ww-tool-icon ww-icon-amber" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3.5" y="6" width="17" height="12" rx="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.5"/><path d="M6.5 9v.01M17.5 15v.01"/></svg></span><span class="ww-tool-arrow">-></span></div><span class="ww-tool-label">TOTAL REWARDS</span><h3>Pay & benefits</h3><p>Explore benefit information and understand which figures are examples versus confirmed records.</p><span class="ww-card-link">Explore benefits <span>→</span></span></a>
    <a class="ww-tool-card" href="team"><div class="ww-tool-top"><span class="ww-tool-icon ww-icon-green" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3"/><path d="M3.5 19v-1.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11 0V19z"/><path d="M16 5.5a3 3 0 0 1 0 5.8M17 14a4 4 0 0 1 3.5 4v1"/></svg></span><span class="ww-tool-arrow">-></span></div><span class="ww-tool-label">PEOPLE & TEAMS</span><h3>Team workspace</h3><p>Set up a company workspace and manage the employment records supported by the current version.</p><span class="ww-card-link">Open team tools <span>→</span></span></a>
    <a class="ww-tool-card" href="approvals"><div class="ww-tool-top"><span class="ww-tool-icon ww-icon-green" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3"/><path d="M3.5 19v-1.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11 0V19z"/><path d="M16 5.5a3 3 0 0 1 0 5.8M17 14a4 4 0 0 1 3.5 4v1"/></svg></span><span class="ww-tool-arrow">-></span></div><span class="ww-tool-label">FOR MANAGERS</span><h3>Leave approvals</h3><p>Review submitted requests and record decisions where your account has the required access.</p><span class="ww-card-link">Review approvals <span>→</span></span></a>
    <a class="ww-tool-card" href="policies"><div class="ww-tool-top"><span class="ww-tool-icon ww-icon-blue" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="5" y="4.5" width="14" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M9 4.5v-1h6v1M8.5 10h7M8.5 13.5h7M8.5 17h4"/></svg></span><span class="ww-tool-arrow">-></span></div><span class="ww-tool-label">POLICY & GUIDANCE</span><h3>Rules & balances</h3><p>Review policy information, source-linked references and configured leave balances.</p><span class="ww-card-link">View policies <span>→</span></span></a>
  </section>
  <section class="ww-bottom-band"><div class="ww-bottom-symbol">OK</div><div class="ww-bottom-copy"><strong>Clarity first. Important details stay visible.</strong><p>Work-Wise is an early-access tool, not a payroll or legal-compliance system. Review source material and confirm decisions where needed.</p></div><a href="rules" class="ww-bottom-link">Explore guidance <span>→</span></a></section>
  <footer class="ww-footer"><span>© 2026 Work-Wise</span><span>Clear records. Better conversations.</span></footer>
</div>